      "title": "电商视频提示词｜Picture 1 是商品身份",
      "properties": {
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core",
        "ver": "0.33.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "<Picture 1> is the only product identity reference.\nCreate a five-second vertical ecommerce product film. Preserve the exact product geometry, proportions, colors, material, package structure, logo placement, and label layout as much as possible.\n[0:00-0:02.00] Clean warm studio background, medium close-up. The camera slowly pushes in. The product remains still while soft highlights move naturally across its surface.\n[0:02.00-0:04.00] The camera performs a small smooth orbit to the right, revealing the front and side material with realistic contact shadow and reflection.\n[0:04.00-0:05.00] Return to a centered hero shot and hold steadily.\nNative stereo audio: quiet studio ambience and one soft transition sound. No speech and no lyrics.\nExactly one product. No duplicate, no extra brand, no subtitles, no watermark, no sudden cut, and no deformed package."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "value": "<Picture 1> is the only product identity reference.\nCreate a five-second vertical ecommerce product film. Preserve the exact product geometry, proportions, colors, material, package structure, logo placement, and label layout as much as possible.\n[0:00-0:02.00] Clean warm studio background, medium close-up. The camera slowly pushes in. The product remains still while soft highlights move naturally across its surface.\n[0:02.00-0:04.00] The camera performs a small smooth orbit to the right, revealing the front and side material with realistic contact shadow and reflection.\n[0:04.00-0:05.00] Return to a centered hero shot and hold steadily.\nNative stereo audio: quiet studio ambience and one soft transition sound. No speech and no lyrics.\nExactly one product. No duplicate, no extra brand, no subtitles, no watermark, no sudden cut, and no deformed package."
      },
      "color": "#322",
      "bgcolor": "#533"
    },
